A little bit of wizmode experimenting has exposed a MAJOR abuse method for
getting unlimited power/exp boosts from Foocubi.

The fact that makes this abuse possible is this: when you stone-to-flesh
a statue of a foocubus, it comes to life immediately "ready for action".
This is regardless of whether the pre-stoned foocubus was unready
(headache) or cancelled (severe headache).

Also, if you have maximum lifting capacity, you can pick up a statue of a
foocubus, and if you put it in a bag of holding, you should still be able
to climb stairs.

Therefore, you can build an "orgy room" on Sokoban 1.

Step 1) Create a few foocubi from sinks.  Three is plenty.
Step 2) Carefully turn them into statues (don't let them steal your gloves).
Step 3) Transport the statues, one at a time, to Sokoban 1.
Step 4) Tame a cockatrice or chickatrice
Step 5) Learn "stone-to-flesh".  Bring the spellbook with you.
Step 6) Create the "orgy room", with burned-in Elbereth's and cursed items.
Step 7) Put on an amulet of life saving (to protect against accidents).
Step 8) Start the cycle of "cast stone-to-flesh", #chat, repeat.

It makes nurse dancing seem like NOTHING.  Be sure you bring enough food.
Also, a source of unworn magic resistance is handy.

Note, "Create Nasty" storms can be very dangerous when you are at high
level.

